    "description": "<p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a></i> </p><p>A&nbsp;3rd-Degree&nbsp;or&nbsp;Class Three Droid&nbsp;is a Droid&nbsp;programmed for interaction with organic beings in services such as&nbsp;childcare,&nbsp;diplomacy, interpreting, teaching, and the social sciences.&nbsp;Protocol Droids&nbsp;and&nbsp;Service Droids&nbsp;are 3rd-Degree Droids. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3rd-Degree_Droid_Traits\">3rd-Degree Droid Traits</span></h3><p>3rd-Degree Droids have the following traits: </p><ul>\n <li><b>Ability Modifiers:</b> All 3rd-Degree Droids receive +2 bonuses to both their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>, but suffer a -2 penalty to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Behavioral Inhibitors:</b> 3rd-Degree Droids firstly cannot knowingly harm a sentient creature, unless another creature would be harmed due to inaction. 3rd-Degree Droids secondly obey orders from their designated owner (whether that be an actual owner or themselves).</li> \n <li><b>Droid Traits:</b> All 3rd-Degree Droids posses <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Traits\" title=\"Droid Traits\">Droid Traits</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Droid Talents:</b> All 3rd-Degree Droids can select <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Talents\" title=\"Droid Talents\">Droid Talents</a> from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/3rd-Degree_Droid_Talent_Tree\" title=\"3rd-Degree Droid Talent Tree\">3rd-Degree Droid Talent Tree</a>.</li>\n</ul><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/3PO-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"3PO-Series Protocol Droid\">3PO-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additional_3rd-Degree_Droids\">Additional 3rd-Degree Droids</span></h2><p>The below details all 3rd-Degree Droid Models found within the <i>Star Wars Saga Edition</i> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reference_Books\" title=\"Reference Books\">Reference Books</a>. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Threats_of_the_Galaxy\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Threats of the Galaxy\">Threats of the Galaxy</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/M-3PO-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"M-3PO-Series Protocol Droid\">M-3PO-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/TC-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"TC-Series Protocol Droid\">TC-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Droids play an important part in any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Republic_Campaign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Old Republic Campaign\">Old Republic Campaign</a>. Droids are just as prominent during the days of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Old_Republic\" title=\"The Old Republic\">The Old Republic</a> as they are in later years, and many models are the obvious predecessors of Droids used during the Galactic Civil War. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/GE3-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"GE3-Series Protocol Droid\">GE3-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/GG-Series_Hospitality_Droid\" title=\"GG-Series Hospitality Droid\">GG-Series Hospitality Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Though rarely used for true military purposes, 3rd-Degree Droids are often the face of the political forces behind combat forces. As a result, many models were as hated as the owners who sent them to inform local populations that an army was approaching and all buildings and possessions in the area were being confiscated. Although every major government and organization continues to use 3rd-Degree Droids to ease negotiations straight though the Clone Wars and in the years beyond, the attitude of many less powerful civilians toward Droids took a sour turn for many decades. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BD-3000_Luxury_Droid\" title=\"BD-3000 Luxury Droid\">BD-3000 Luxury Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/RA-7_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"RA-7 Protocol Droid\">RA-7 Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scum_and_Villainy\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scum and Villainy\">Scum and Villainy</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/J9_Worker_Drone\" title=\"J9 Worker Drone\">J9 Worker Drone</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/K-Series_Spaceport_Control_Droid\" title=\"K-Series Spaceport Control Droid\">K-Series Spaceport Control Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>The Clone Wars saw the rapid development of Droid technology, mainly due to the Separatists' heavy reliance on Droid military units. The&nbsp;Droids&nbsp;presented in this chapter are some of the models found in use in nonmilitary capacities. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/5YQ-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"5YQ-Series Protocol Droid\">5YQ-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Since the years of the Clone Wars, every major government and organization has used 3rd-Degree Droids to inform local populations of the impending arrival of troops (and the impending seizure of property and goods). As a result, most civilians greet the arrival of 3rd-Degree Droids with open hostility. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Imperial_Espionage_Droid\" title=\"Imperial Espionage Droid\">Imperial Espionage Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/LOM-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"LOM-Series Protocol Droid\">LOM-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galaxy_at_War\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Galaxy_at_War\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Galaxy at War\">Galaxy at War</a></span></h3><p>Although soldiers are loath to admit it, Droids can be invaluable assets in battle, whether as support or as front-line combatants. Even in eras when Droids are less common or distrusted- such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Dark_Times\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Dark Times\">The Dark Times</a>- they are still utilized in some fashion. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Chiba_DR-10_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"Chiba DR-10 Protocol Droid\">Chiba DR-10 Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span id=\"Scavenger.27s_Guide_to_Droids\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scavenger's_Guide_to_Droids\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/CZ-Series_Secretary_Droid\" title=\"CZ-Series Secretary Droid\">CZ-Series Secretary Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/EV-Series_Supervisor_Droid\" title=\"EV-Series Supervisor Droid\">EV-Series Supervisor Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/GY-I_Information_Analysis_Droid\" title=\"GY-I Information Analysis Droid\">GY-I Information Analysis Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/LEP_Service_Droid\" title=\"LEP Service Droid\">LEP Service Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/RWW-Series_Protocol_Droid\" title=\"RWW-Series Protocol Droid\">RWW-Series Protocol Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/TT-8L_Gatekeeper_Droid\" title=\"TT-8L Gatekeeper Droid\">TT-8L Gatekeeper Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galaxy_of_Intrigue\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Galaxy of Intrigue\">Galaxy of Intrigue</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/3D-4_Administrative_Droid\" title=\"3D-4 Administrative Droid\">3D-4 Administrative Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/M4-Series_Messenger_Droid\" title=\"M4-Series Messenger Droid\">M4-Series Messenger Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unknown_Regions\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/AS23_Aerial_Survey_Droid\" title=\"AS23 Aerial Survey Droid\">AS23 Aerial Survey Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Homebrew_3rd-Degree_Droids\">Homebrew 3rd-Degree Droids</span></h2><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p>The following are a collection of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> 3rd-Degree Droid Models created through <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a>. Their use may only be permitted with the express permission of the Gamemaster. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BT7-Series_Valet_Droid\" title=\"BT7-Series Valet Droid\">BT7-Series Valet Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
